sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as MCP client
    participant MCP as MCP server
    participant AS as Authorization server
    C->>MCP: Request without a token
    MCP->>C: 401 with WWW-Authenticate and resource_metadata
    C->>MCP: GET protected resource metadata
    MCP->>C: authorization_servers and scopes_supported
    C->>AS: GET authorization server metadata
    AS->>C: Authorization and token endpoints
    C->>AS: Authorization code + PKCE with resource set to the MCP server URL
    AS->>C: access_token
    C->>MCP: Request with Bearer access_token
